                  <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1 fullwidth-split-text">
                     <div class="text-wrapper">
                        
                        <h2>Discover What's Possible at HC</h2>
                        
                        <h3>There is something for everyone</h3>
                        We offer Associates Degrees, Career &amp; Technical Education, Health Professions, Teacher
                        Education, and Workforce Training and Continuing Education.<br>
                        
